---
// Timeline in seconds: 1 s = 330 px from x=210. COMMIT is slowed to 1 s on
// purpose so the order is visible. Values from the curl capture in the post.
const W = 900, H = 300;
const x0 = 210, k = 330;
const X = (t: number) => x0 + t * k;
---
<figure class="bep5c">
  <div class="bep5c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two timelines in seconds. Default scope: the endpoint returns, the client has its 200 at 0.015 seconds, then COMMIT runs for one second. scope function: the endpoint returns, COMMIT runs for one second, then the client gets its 200 at about 1.0 seconds.">
    <line x1={x0} y1="262" x2={X(1.2)} y2="262" class="ln" />
    {[0, 0.5, 1].map((t) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={X(t)} y1="258" x2={X(t)} y2="266" class="ln" />
        <text x={X(t)} y="282" text-anchor="middle" class="sub">{t} s</text>
      </g>
    ))}

    <text x="40" y="52" class="nm mono">default</text>
    <text x="40" y="70" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>commit after response</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>commit sau response</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x={X(0)} y="40" width="5" height="34" class="box" />
    <rect x={X(0.02)} y="40" width={k} height="34" rx="6" class="bad" />
    <text x={X(0.02) + k / 2} y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="mono redt">COMMIT 1 s</text>
    <polygon points={`${X(0.015)},34 ${X(0.015) - 5},24 ${X(0.015) + 5},24`} class="badfill" />
    <text x={X(0.015) + 12} y="26" class="redt">
      <tspan data-lang-en>client already has its 200 (0.015 s)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>client đã nhận 200 (0.015 s)</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="40" y="162" class="nm mono">scope="function"</text>
    <text x="40" y="180" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>commit before response</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>commit trước response</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x={X(0)} y="150" width="5" height="34" class="box" />
    <rect x={X(0.02)} y="150" width={k} height="34" rx="6" class="good" />
    <text x={X(0.02) + k / 2} y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="mono goodt">COMMIT 1 s</text>
    <polygon points={`${X(1.006)},144 ${X(1.006) - 5},134 ${X(1.006) + 5},134`} class="hd" />
    <text x={X(1.006) + 12} y="136" class="goodt">
      <tspan data-lang-en>200 sent after the commit (1.006 s)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>200 chỉ gửi sau commit (1.006 s)</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x={X(0)} y="105" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>the tiny box at 0 s is the endpoint itself</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ô nhỏ ở mốc 0 s là bản thân endpoint</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A dependency with yield runs its after-yield code after the response by default. A commit that fails there cannot change the answer the client already got.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Dependency có yield mặc định chạy phần sau yield sau khi đã trả response. Commit lỗi ở đó cũng không đổi được câu trả lời client đã nhận.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep5c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep5c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep5c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep5c text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep5c .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep5c .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14.5px; }
  .bep5c .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5c .mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5c .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5c .seam { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .bep5c .good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep5c .bad { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5c .badfill { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep5c .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep5c .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5c .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5c .goodt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
